    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "This dish takes about 45 minutes and serves 4 as part of a shared meal. The aubergine is fried until golden and tender, then tossed in a sauce built on"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "doubanjiang",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "doubanjiang"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ", garlic, ginger,"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "rice vinegar",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "rice-vinegar"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "and sugar. The result is the classic"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "yu xiang",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "yu-xiang"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "balance: tangy, spicy and faintly sweet."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Salt the aubergine pieces for 20 minutes before cooking. This draws out moisture so they absorb less oil and colour faster. Pat them very dry before they go into the wok."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
